{"id":"w26qnwjjpzpbusa72owmzheyy","title":"CellMarker 3.0：升级版人类和小鼠细胞标志物","originalTitle":null,"summary":"CellMarker 3.0 是对人类和小鼠细胞标志物的全面升级版，整合了 16,172 篇已发表论文中的 6 种细胞类型识别算法，新增 1,245,923 条组织-细胞类型关联标记记录，涵盖 274 种组织和 1,877 种细胞类型。该资源提供详细的多维注释信息，并新增了两个空间转录组学分析工具。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=571917&do=blog&id=1561154"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T03:28:32.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T08:34:31.457Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T08:34:31.457Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":40,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"1c8faab1-f21d-4f0b-b79d-9b17269082c8","title":"CellMarker 3.0发布：整合超16万篇论文数据升级细胞标记物"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"1c8faab1-f21d-4f0b-b79d-9b17269082c8","title":"CellMarker 3.0发布：整合超16万篇论文数据升级细胞标记物"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fEydVFKNd1Lo","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}